Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":1,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":23,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1916767,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":288000,"Name":"Quich1948","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-288000.jpg?_r=1478312205","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1479556169,"LastPoster":{"Id":288000,"Name":"Quich1948","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-288000.jpg?_r=1478312205","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":33,"Preview":{"Id":1916767,"PostDate":1479556169,"PostContent":"Hopefully, this is going to be your first and only marriage as you have found your life partner....","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rdrobertson@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"14.1.100.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1478297408,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-288000.jpg?_r=1478312205","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Quich1948","Id":288000,"Name":"Quich1948","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"103.77.63.2","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80847,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e76e019a12860e63c5420fb7285dfc8f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Hopefully, this is going to be your first and only marriage as you have found your life partner. A wedding is something that needs lots of careful planning. Use the tips that follow to help you create a fabulous wedding.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:wingdings;\"&gt;\u00fc &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Practice your walk down the aisle many times on the days leading up to the wedding. This needs to be done where the wedding is going to be held so that you&#039;re familiar with the specific area and flooring as well as how your shoes react. Your overall flow will be far smoother for your big day.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:wingdings;\"&gt;\u00fc &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Once you know who all is going to give a speech at &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/254-show-us-your-rings\/&#039;&gt;your wedding&lt;\/a&gt;, hold a rehearsal for everyone so you can censor out inappropriate material. There will be people of all ages present, and what may seem funny to a younger person may not be humorous to an older crowd.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/macys-o.scene7.com\/is\/image\/MCY\/products\/0\/optimized\/804870_fpx.tif?wid=224&amp;amp;qlt=90,0\" alt=\"804870_fpx.tif?wid=224&amp;amp;qlt=90,0\"&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:wingdings;\"&gt;\u00fc &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;For an impressive appeal - &lt;strong&gt;emerald earrings&lt;\/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;gold charms&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;, or &lt;strong&gt;silver bracelets&lt;\/strong&gt; - consider renting out the not-so-needed &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.boutiqueken.com\/cat\/jewelry-all-wedding-jewelry&#039;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;wedding jewelry&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt; and accessories for the big event. You will still look stunning but won&#039;t have to spend a lot, so your budget stays intact.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:wingdings;\"&gt;\u00fc &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Be certain that your reception venue has a good-sized dance area. There is nothing worse than being crammed like sardines while the people around you are trying to do the Mashed Potato, so move some tables and chairs to make the extra room you need to get your groove on!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:wingdings;\"&gt;\u00fc &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Aim for a mid-day reception. Alcohol consumption will be less during a day reception, which could help to reduce costs. Having your wedding during the midday can also cut food costs and even get you a discount for booking during the day.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:wingdings;\"&gt;\u00fc &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Send each guest an online itinerary, so that they know exactly when and where every important event will be. Make sure that you tell people if they need to attend events, like the rehearsal, so that everyone shows up promptly at the correct location.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;A wedding is a huge step for a couple to take so the wedding day should reflect the importance of this and celebrate the joining of two people.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1916767,"PostDate":1479556169,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Hopefully, this is going to be your first and only marriage as you have found your life partner. A wedding is something that needs lots of careful planning. Use the tips that follow to help you create a fabulous wedding.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:wingdings\">\u00fc <\/span><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Practice your walk down the aisle many times on the days leading up to the wedding. This needs to be done where the wedding is going to be held so that you're familiar with the specific area and flooring as well as how your shoes react. Your overall flow will be far smoother for your big day.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:wingdings\">\u00fc <\/span><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Once you know who all is going to give a speech at <a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/254-show-us-your-rings\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>your wedding<\/a>, hold a rehearsal for everyone so you can censor out inappropriate material. There will be people of all ages present, and what may seem funny to a younger person may not be humorous to an older crowd.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/macys-o.scene7.com\/is\/image\/MCY\/products\/0\/optimized\/804870_fpx.tif?wid=224&qlt=90,0\" alt=\"804870_fpx.tif?wid=224&qlt=90,0\"><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:wingdings\">\u00fc <\/span><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">For an impressive appeal - <strong>emerald earrings<\/strong>, <strong>gold charms<\/strong><\/span>, or <strong>silver bracelets<\/strong> - consider renting out the not-so-needed <a href='https:\/\/www.boutiqueken.com\/cat\/jewelry-all-wedding-jewelry' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><strong>wedding jewelry<\/strong><\/a> and accessories for the big event. You will still look stunning but won't have to spend a lot, so your budget stays intact.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:wingdings\">\u00fc <\/span><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Be certain that your reception venue has a good-sized dance area. There is nothing worse than being crammed like sardines while the people around you are trying to do the Mashed Potato, so move some tables and chairs to make the extra room you need to get your groove on!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:wingdings\">\u00fc <\/span><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Aim for a mid-day reception. Alcohol consumption will be less during a day reception, which could help to reduce costs. Having your wedding during the midday can also cut food costs and even get you a discount for booking during the day.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:wingdings\">\u00fc <\/span><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Send each guest an online itinerary, so that they know exactly when and where every important event will be. Make sure that you tell people if they need to attend events, like the rehearsal, so that everyone shows up promptly at the correct location.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">A wedding is a huge step for a couple to take so the wedding day should reflect the importance of this and celebrate the joining of two people.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rdrobertson@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"14.1.100.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1478297408,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-288000.jpg?_r=1478312205","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Quich1948","Id":288000,"Name":"Quich1948","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80847","Title":"More Than You Thought About Weddings And Wedding Plans","LastPostDate":1479556169},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
